{"reviews":[{"id":"B0713WDNK4-0","r":1.0,"t":"It was like rubbing plastic mesh on my skin with no soap","x":"I thought these would soften up a bit when they got wet but they don\u2019t. I used a ton of soap and they didn\u2019t lather either. It was like rubbing plastic mesh on my skin with no soap.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-1","r":4.0,"t":"probably a better exfoliater than a traditional one","x":"These little jobbies are not too shabby. It's not your typical loofa. The sponge is tougher, not as soft, probably a better exfoliater than a traditional one. My only complaint is that it slips off my hand pretty easily even while using the strap, but that's not a huge deal.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-2","r":4.0,"t":"Needs to be all loofah","x":"Kinda rough and will definitely exfoliate.  Even tear off scabs. The cloth backing makes it easy to handle but it gets all gunky after awhile.  Might as well be all loofah.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-3","r":4.0,"t":"very stiff and kinda hard to hold","x":"These are very stiff and kinda hard to hold even with the band...","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-4","r":2.0,"t":"Good quality, but small for bathing.","x":"The quality of these loofahs are somewhat decent, but the size is too small for bathing.  They are more like a larger face loofah, not a body loofah. I have small hands & they kept slipping off of my hand, plus the material is too smooth to exfoliate well. (more like using a piece of plastic than a loofah)  I am a lifelong loofah user and I returned them, my search continues.  (I use to get these over the yrs at Target or a drugstore and those were sized well)","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great Loofa!","x":"I love these! They are course enough to make you feel like you are getting a good exfoliation but also get soap sudsy. They seem durable and are holding up well. Love that they came with so many for the price. But my favorite is that they are comprised of good ingredients and I can feel better about not rubbing the normal bpa plastic ones all over my body.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-6","r":5.0,"t":"Love these!","x":"Love these!! they get all your dead skin off and leave your skin feeling so smooth. The handle on the back is perfect for scrubbing your back and hard to reach places too. And they are really easy to rinse to clean and look brand new each time.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-7","r":5.0,"t":"I like these so much","x":"I like these so much. After than those bright colored plastic &#34;loofah&#34; you st at the store. They expholiate just the right amount. I'll buy them when I run out, but they last a while.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great for Exfoliation","x":"Love them! Great for gentle exfoliation. They don't feel like wiry scouring pads. Small cloth band on back allows them to be grasped well or hung on a shower hook.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-9","r":5.0,"t":"These pads really work.","x":"Plain and simple, they really work on dry skin.  Know that the pad remains stiff even when soaked, but easy to hold and work with.  Great purchase, very pleased.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-10","r":5.0,"t":"Very effective","x":"These loofah sponge pads are convenient to use, just the right size for your hand and effective at their job.  They are a good value, too.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-11","r":1.0,"t":"Dirty loofahs","x":"They all came dirty!!! With spots and dust on them. Better to get a more expensive pack that's clean","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-12","r":5.0,"t":"Will buy again","x":"Took a good while to arrive and are large in size. A good value, albeit not fast to get in hand.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-13","r":1.0,"t":"Harsh","x":"Horrible product unless you yearn for extreme exfoliation. Very disappointed in this product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great loofah","x":"It really does expand. Great for exfoliating the body. Too stiff to use for the face.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-15","r":5.0,"t":"loofah sponge pack","x":"This is a great product.  Exceeded expectations.  Very well made.  Recieved fast.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-16","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality","x":"These are as good as it gets. Been looking for this quality for years and found.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-17","r":5.0,"t":"Serenity Sponge","x":"This item works very well. Does exactly like advertised. Great product","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-18","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to use!","x":"Just what I was looking for. Prompt service, quality product","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-19","r":5.0,"t":"Durable","x":"Great price for a pack of 8!  Keep it dry by hanging it up!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-20","r":5.0,"t":"excellent value","x":"Looks just like the store brand products","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-21","r":5.0,"t":"I've been looking everywhere for these!","x":"Exactly what I was looking for! I have been looking for this product for years! I bought one from walmart many years ago when i was in high school and LOVED it! When I tried to buy more I could never find it anywhere and walmart no longer carried it (I also didn't know what they were called). This thing is my holy grail in my skin care routine. This buffs out the small little acne bumps on my face and makes my face feel soft to the touch. If it's your first time trying this then just know it wil","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great value and good enough for me!","x":"I just threw away the first one and it lasted just short of two months? So with an 8 pack that\u2019ll last at least a year and a quarter if the trend keeps on if not longer, I\u2019m kind of rough with my scrubbing. Overall, GREAT value compared to how frequently I normally go through regular loofahs/sponges.  It\u2019s a little stiff at first which is understandable but it makes it a little difficult to scrub with. It\u2019ll soften up after several uses though. The strap on the back is basically useless. I just ","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-23","r":4.0,"t":"Love these loofahs!!","x":"These are great! Very easy to hold with the strap on the back that my hand fits through & the little loop on the top makes it easy to hand on a hook in my shower! I add a little bit of my shower gel & easily wash my entire body. They are great strong loofah that gives you a nice exfoliation but still soft enough that they never scratch your skin at all!! I will definitely order them again. Although this pack will last my daughter & I awhile! Great deal!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B0713WDNK4-24","r":5.0,"t":"Great Sponges.  Great Price","x":"Love my little sponges.  Great to keep in the shower.  Perfect fit for my hand.  Hate using those long loofahs....these natural sponges are the perfect fit.  High quality and love they come in an 8 pak as toss as they wear out and have another handy and good to go.  Thanks for a great product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find these loofahs effective for exfoliation, describing them as rough enough to remove dead skin and leave skin smooth.","cites":[2,3,6,7,8,9,10,11,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the pads are stiff or rough, which some appreciate for exfoliation but others find harsh or uncomfortable.","cites":[1,3,4,10,14,15]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the loofahs slip off the hand easily, even when using the strap or band.","cites":[2,4,5]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention the size is too small for body bathing, comparing them to face loofahs.","cites":[5]},{"text":"A few reviewers report quality issues such as arriving dirty or the cloth backing getting gunky.","cites":[3,12]}]},"qa":[]}